  "outcomes": [
    "Global activation lock uses effective creature1/artifact16/planeswalker64 kinds on battlefield, both actors, mana and nonmana. Other kinds and Hand/GY abilities remain legal; suppression/departure and projected sacrifice unlock it.",
    "Own-turn plus actual own-graveyard departure history gates activation before announcement, resets each turn, and is not rechecked as a resolution condition.",
    "Attachment-granted hexproof blocks opposing exactly-one-color sources, with effective colors/selected face/departure LKI, and layer-six recipient/provider suppression.",
    "Warrior-token cannot-sacrifice ability is conditional on provider own end step/current controller, recipient type/control, layer-six removal and later grant timestamps; actual and speculative payment worlds agree.",
    "Attack-only extra triggers are separate from ordinary multiplicity; actual permanent source controller qualifies, each independent Decayed instance duplicates, ETB/tap/damage and independent delayed packets do not. Multiple providers add instances, printed once-per-turn caps them. Queued counts survive source loss and owned raw/index/restore.",
    "Temporary additive creature types preserve original subtypes/stats/copiable recipe, observe timestamp/exact incarnation, survive ability loss and expire at cleanup.",
    "Integration-only printed-front CopyRecipe initializes sampled_size:None; the separate CR111.5 fix replaces this literal with CopyRecipe::new."
  ],
